WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.800
A.

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.500
Drill,

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.167
B.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:02.833
Milk,

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:03.500
C.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Hammer,

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.533
or D.

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:06.233
Saw?

00:00:06.233 --> 00:00:07.567
Five seconds!

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:14.033
TIME'S UP!

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.767
The answer is...

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:16.200
B,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:16.633
milk!

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:17.500
A hammer,

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:17.933
drill,

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:19.667
and saw are tools.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.400
Milk is a drink,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.600
so it does not belong.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.833
A.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:25.600
Bottom-right,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.333
B.

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.067
Top-right,

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:27.800
C.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.567
Bottom-left,

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:30.033
or D.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:30.767
Center?

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.267
Five seconds!

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:38.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:40.467
The answer is...

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:40.933
A,

00:00:40.933 --> 00:00:41.367
bottom-right!

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:43.167
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:44.533
around the corners,

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:47.200
so the next spot is bottom-right.

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:48.533
A.

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:49.300
Forty-three,

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.100
B.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.867
Thirty-eight,

00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:51.667
C.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:52.433
Thirty-six,

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:54.033
or D.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:54.800
Thirty-five?

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.367
Five seconds!

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:02.833
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:04.433
The answer is...

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:04.833
B,

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:05.233
thirty-eight!

00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:07.567
The gaps grow by the same

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:08.767
amount each step,

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:11.100
so the next number is thirty-eight.

00:01:11.633 --> 00:01:12.000
So,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.800
are you smart or fart?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.000
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.067
